      "proposalQuote": "We can confirm that data storage is included in the costs to be provided to the State.",
      "explanation": "The proposal defers commercial cost information rather than providing required pricing details.",
      "fix": "Provide a complete itemized pricing schedule with total cost rather than stating figures are to be provided."
