      "location": "§33.2",
      "proposalQuote": "Develop project schedule with key milestones (including specified deliverables)",
      "explanation": "Omitting milestone calendar dates and phase durations prevents the client from determining if the mandatory implementation deadline can be achieved.",
      "fix": "Provide a project schedule populated with specific durations and calendar target dates for all deliverables."
    }
  ],
